{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21093","headline":"松树 · 元稹","name":"松树","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"华山高幢幢，上有高高松。\n株株遥各各，叶叶相重重。\n槐树夹道植，枝叶俱冥蒙。\n既无贞直干，复有罥挂虫。\n何不种松树，使之摇清风。\n秦时已曾种，顦顇种不供。\n可怜孤松意，不与槐树同。\n闲在高山顶，樛盘虯与龙。\n屈爲大厦栋，庇荫侯与公。\n不肯作行伍，俱在尘土中。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21093.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21093","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}